@TheHillEvents All kind of drugs will affect in some degree our Nerve system. 
There was a woman complaining that she became deft after be vaccinated with COVID-19.
It says that there is a chemical ingredient in vaccines that blocked up some kind of hair nerves in the internal auditory nerve.

@TheHillEvents @RepKimSchrier Scientific outcomes are constantly changing and to assume that it's always the same is wrong.
It's our nature to question a 'rule' and challenge it to ensure its reliability. 
It is fair to be 'sceptic' and always question science or else it is a dictatorship
